  <running_head>De Quarto Praecepto.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">tempestiva confessio, <i>quae citra officii</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>necessitatem fit.</i> Matt.7.v.6.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">Adsit jam Quartum praeceptum.</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Quartum praeceptum, <i>de adjuncto</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>tempore cultus Dei solennis, vult:</i> Ut Dei</l>
    <l n="6" type="heading" level="2">Sabbathum sanctificetur; neque ullo</l>
    <l n="7" type="heading" level="2">modo polluatur.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Sanctificatio sabbathi, <i>est celebratio</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>diei publico Dei cultui destinati, quum ab</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>operibus vocationis communibus quiescen-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>tes, in publicum Ecclesiae coetum conveniunt,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>ad cultus divini exercitium.</i> Actor.20.v.7.</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>Prohibentur ergo hic:</i> 1. Opera com-</l>
    <l n="14">munia vocationis, <i>extra casum praesentis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>necessitatis die festo suscepta.</i> Exo.16.v.29.</l>
    <l n="16">Nehem.13.v.15.seq. 2. Aperta sabbathi</l>
    <l n="17">profanatio: <i>quae fit indulgendo carnis cu-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>piditatibus.</i> Jesa.58.v.13. 3. Externa tan-</l>
    <l n="19">tum &amp; hypocritica sabbathi observa-</l>
    <l n="20">tio, <i>sine cultu pietatis interno.</i> Jesaj.1.v.14.</l>
    <l n="21">4. Consecratio dierum festorum in ho-</l>
    <l n="22">norem creaturae alicujus. Exod.20.v.10.</l>
    <l n="23" type="foot" para="true">Dictum est de Charitate erga Deum,</l>
    <l n="24" type="foot">in Prima Decalogi Tabula: se-</l>
    <l n="25" type="foot">quitur illa quae est erga</l>
    <l n="26" type="foot">Homines.</l>
  </main_text>
